3. Maintenance note
================================================================================

Section 1 describes material actually shipped in this repository and must be
kept accurate. When the palette values are replaced with original ones
(PRD RF-50b, Phase 5), the Catppuccin entry above should be moved from
section 1 to section 2 and reworded as "the palette structure and token naming
were inspired by", provided no original hex values remain.

Do not remove the entry outright: token names such as `mauve`, `rosewater` and
`crust` are themselves borrowed vocabulary.
